# VS Code REST Client request for the development API.
# Define IMHEALTH_DEV_API_BASE_URL and IMHEALTH_DEV_COGNITO_ID_TOKEN in a local
# .env file (do not commit the token). The base URL should include the /dev stage.
# This POST starts an ECS task and writes today's mental health trend snapshot.

@baseUrl = {{$dotenv IMHEALTH_DEV_API_BASE_URL}}
@idToken = {{$dotenv IMHEALTH_DEV_COGNITO_ID_TOKEN}}

### Start the mental health trend snapshot task
POST {{baseUrl}}/task-runner
Authorization: {{idToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
